<title>UK: NWE jet inactive, spreads steady.</title>
<headline>NWE jet inactive, spreads steady.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fuel business was inactive on Friday while cargo differentials were notionally stable, traders aid.</p>
<p>Discussion was muted because a European major with a central role in jet trade was out of the market for much of the day due to a company function, they said.</p>
<p>Barge differentials were assessed at July IPE +$16/$16.50. Cargoes were around July IPE +$15.</p>
<p>July IPE last traded down $2.50 a tonne at $162.</p>
</text>
